## Article 150. Securing administrative claim

```catala
declaration scope Article150SecuringClaim:
  input check content SecuringClaimCheck
  output securingClaimAvailable content YesNo
  output groundsForSecuring content YesNo

scope Article150SecuringClaim:
  label securing_default definition securingClaimAvailable equals No

# Securing available when there is risk of irreparable harm
  label securing_available exception securing_default
  definition securingClaimAvailable under condition
    check.irreparableHarmRisk = Yes
    and check.measureProportionate = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label grounds definition groundsForSecuring under condition
    securingClaimAvailable = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_grounds definition groundsForSecuring under condition
    securingClaimAvailable = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 151. Types of securing measures

```catala
declaration scope Article151SecuringMeasures:
  input check content SecuringClaimCheck
  output measureAvailable content YesNo
  output applicableMeasure content SecuringMeasure

scope Article151SecuringMeasures:
# Stay enforcement of challenged act
  label measure_stay_available definition measureAvailable under condition
    check.measureRequested = StayEnforcementOfAct
    and check.actAlreadyEnforced = No
    consequence equals Yes

# Prohibit specific actions
  label measure_prohibit_available definition measureAvailable under condition
    check.measureRequested = ProhibitSpecificActions
    consequence equals Yes

# Compel specific actions
  label measure_compel_available definition measureAvailable under condition
    check.measureRequested = CompelSpecificActions
    consequence equals Yes

# Seize property
  label measure_seize_available definition measureAvailable under condition
    check.measureRequested = SeizeProperty
    and check.measureProportionate = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Prohibit alienation
  label measure_alienation_available definition measureAvailable under condition
    check.measureRequested = ProhibitAlienationOfProperty
    consequence equals Yes

# Suspend disputed decision
  label measure_suspend_available definition measureAvailable under condition
    check.measureRequested = SuspendDisputedDecision
    and check.actAlreadyEnforced = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Map to applicable measure
  label measure_stay definition applicableMeasure under condition
    check.measureRequested = StayEnforcementOfAct
    consequence equals StayEnforcementOfAct

  label measure_prohibit definition applicableMeasure under condition
    check.measureRequested = ProhibitSpecificActions
    consequence equals ProhibitSpecificActions

  label measure_compel definition applicableMeasure under condition
    check.measureRequested = CompelSpecificActions
    consequence equals CompelSpecificActions

  label measure_seize definition applicableMeasure under condition
    check.measureRequested = SeizeProperty
    consequence equals SeizeProperty

  label measure_alienation definition applicableMeasure under condition
    check.measureRequested = ProhibitAlienationOfProperty
    consequence equals ProhibitAlienationOfProperty

  label measure_suspend definition applicableMeasure under condition
    check.measureRequested = SuspendDisputedDecision
    consequence equals SuspendDisputedDecision
```

## Article 152. Filing for securing measures

```catala
declaration scope Article152FilingSecuring:
  input check content SecuringClaimCheck
  input filedSimultaneouslyWithClaim content YesNo
  input filedDuringHearing content YesNo
  output securingCanBeFiled content YesNo

scope Article152FilingSecuring:
  label filing_default definition securingCanBeFiled equals No

# Can be filed with the statement of claim
  label filing_with_claim exception filing_default
  definition securingCanBeFiled under condition
    filedSimultaneouslyWithClaim = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Can be filed during hearing
  label filing_during_hearing exception filing_default
  definition securingCanBeFiled under condition
    filedDuringHearing = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 153. Court consideration of securing request

```catala
declaration scope Article153SecuringConsideration:
  input check content SecuringClaimCheck
  input requestFiledBeforeHearing content YesNo
  output sameDayConsideration content YesNo

scope Article153SecuringConsideration:
# Request before hearing → considered same day
  label same_day definition sameDayConsideration under condition
    requestFiledBeforeHearing = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_same_day definition sameDayConsideration under condition
    requestFiledBeforeHearing = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 154. Court decision on securing

```catala
declaration scope Article154SecuringDecision:
  input check content SecuringClaimCheck
  output securingGranted content YesNo
  output plaintiffMustProvideSecurity content YesNo

scope Article154SecuringDecision:
  label granted_default definition securingGranted equals No

# Grant when grounds exist and measure is proportionate
  label granted_exception exception granted_default
  definition securingGranted under condition
    check.irreparableHarmRisk = Yes
    and check.measureProportionate = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Court may require plaintiff to provide security
  label security_default definition plaintiffMustProvideSecurity equals No

  label security_required exception security_default
  definition plaintiffMustProvideSecurity under condition
    securingGranted = Yes
    and check.case.plaintiff = LegalEntity
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 155. Replacing one securing measure with another

```catala
declaration scope Article155ReplacingMeasure:
  input originalMeasureGranted content YesNo
  input newMeasureMoreAppropriate content YesNo
  output canReplaceMeasure content YesNo

scope Article155ReplacingMeasure:
  label replace_default definition canReplaceMeasure equals No

  label replace_exception exception replace_default
  definition canReplaceMeasure under condition
    originalMeasureGranted = Yes
    and newMeasureMoreAppropriate = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 156. Cancellation of securing measures

```catala
declaration scope Article156Cancellation:
  input securingGranted content YesNo
  input caseResolved content YesNo
  input groundsNoLongerExist content YesNo
  input defendantRequestsCancellation content YesNo
  output securingMustBeCancelled content YesNo

scope Article156Cancellation:
  label cancel_default definition securingMustBeCancelled equals No

# Cancel when case is resolved
  label cancel_resolved exception cancel_default
  definition securingMustBeCancelled under condition
    securingGranted = Yes
    and caseResolved = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Cancel when grounds no longer exist
  label cancel_grounds exception cancel_default
  definition securingMustBeCancelled under condition
    securingGranted = Yes
    and groundsNoLongerExist = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Defendant can request cancellation
  label cancel_defendant exception cancel_default
  definition securingMustBeCancelled under condition
    securingGranted = Yes
    and defendantRequestsCancellation = Yes
    and groundsNoLongerExist = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 157. Compensation for securing measures

```catala
declaration scope Article157SecuringCompensation:
  input securingGranted content YesNo
  input plaintiffPrevailed content YesNo
  input defendantSufferedDamages content YesNo
  output plaintiffLiableForDamages content YesNo

scope Article157SecuringCompensation:
# If plaintiff loses and securing caused damages, plaintiff is liable
  label liable_default definition plaintiffLiableForDamages equals No

  label liable_exception exception liable_default
  definition plaintiffLiableForDamages under condition
    securingGranted = Yes
    and plaintiffPrevailed = No
    and defendantSufferedDamages = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 158. Securing in cassation and review

```catala
declaration scope Article158SecuringHigherInstances:
  input caseAtCassation content YesNo
  input caseAtReview content YesNo
  input securingNeeded content YesNo
  output higherInstanceCanSecure content YesNo

scope Article158SecuringHigherInstances:
  label higher_default definition higherInstanceCanSecure equals No

  label higher_cassation exception higher_default
  definition higherInstanceCanSecure under condition
    caseAtCassation = Yes
    and securingNeeded = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label higher_review exception higher_default
  definition higherInstanceCanSecure under condition
    caseAtReview = Yes
    and securingNeeded = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```
